.* SERVICE: the task menu for servicing the system. No golden: pub400
.* refuses GO SERVICE (tools/conformance/golden/phase11/menus).
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='SERVICE'.
:IMPORT NAME=ANZPRB PNLGRP=QHSXCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=DSPSRVSTS PNLGRP=QHSXCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=STRSST PNLGRP=QHSVCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKCNTINF PNLGRP=QHSXCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKPRB PNLGRP=QHSXCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKSRVPVD PNLGRP=QHSXCMD.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS' NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=SERVICE HELP=HLPSERVICE KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Service
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI HELP=WRKPRB OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD WRKPRB'.Work with problems
:MENUI HELP=ANZPRB OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ANZPRB'.Analyze a new problem
:MENUI HELP=DSPSRVSTS OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD DSPSRVSTS'.Display service status
:MENUI HELP=WRKCNTINF OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD WRKCNTINF'.Work with support contact information
:MENUI HELP=WRKSRVPVD OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD WRKSRVPVD'.Work with service providers
:MENUI HELP=STRSST OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD STRSST'.Start system service tools
:MENUI HELP='SERVICE/OPT7' OPTION=7 ACTION='MENU PTF'.Program temporary fixes
:MENUI HELP='SERVICE/OPT8' OPTION=8 ACTION='MENU CMDDMP'.Dump commands
:MENUI HELP='SERVICE/OPT9' OPTION=9 ACTION='MENU CMDTRC'.Trace commands
:MENUI HELP='SERVICE/OPT70' OPTION=70 ACTION='MENU CMDSRV'.Related commands
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPSERVICE.Service - Help
:P.Problems, the service provider, dumps and traces, and the system
service tools.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F13=Information Assistant
:PD.Shows menu INFO.
:PT.F16=System Main menu
:PD.Shows menu MAIN.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SERVICE/OPT7'.Program temporary fixes
:P.Option 7. Shows menu PTF&colon. Program temporary fixes.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SERVICE/OPT8'.Dump commands
:P.Option 8. Shows menu CMDDMP&colon. Dump commands.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SERVICE/OPT9'.Trace commands
:P.Option 9. Shows menu CMDTRC&colon. Trace commands.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SERVICE/OPT70'.Related commands
:P.Option 70. Shows menu CMDSRV&colon. Related commands.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
